"data and\n"
"    use `taguette --database=%(url)s migrate` if you want to proceed."
msgstr ""
"\n"
"    The database schema used by LibreQDA has changed! Because you are not"
" using\n"
"    SQLite, we will not attempt a migration automatically; back up your "
"data and\n"
"    use `taguette --database=%(url)s migrate` if you want to proceed."

